    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d221-a2-a4">

                <pb facs="0655" n="533" sameAs="frus:frus1889/pg533"/>

                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Government
                            Office</hi>,<lb/><placeName><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Nagasaki</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1888-11-27"
                            >November 27, 1888</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 126.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: In answer to your communication of the 10th
                    July last, I now have the honor to forward to you a copy of a letter I received
                    from Governor Watanabe of Kagoshima <pb facs="0656" n="534" xml:id="pg534"/>
                    Ken, furnishing me his views as to the disbursement of the money intended by the
                    Government of the United. States to be presented to the inhabitants of the
                    Tanegashima Island.</p>
                <p>I trust that the letter of Governor Watanabe will explain itself to you.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Y. Kusaka</hi></signed>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">Governor of Nagasaki Ken.</hi></closer>


                <xi:include href="d221-a2-a4-a1.xml" xpointer="d221-a2-a4-a1"/>
